# 数据库 Schema 参考

## 一、工程部 NoSQL 集合（CloudBase）

### users
userId, username, displayName, openid, role(Engineer/Supervisor/Management/Admin), status(active/disabled), factoryId, factoryIds[], pcPassword, createdAt, updatedAt

### assets
assetId, assetName, assetNo, workshop, factoryId, status(active/inactive), createdAt, updatedAt

### parts
partSkuId, partName, partCode(唯一), unit, specModel, factoryId?, active, source(manual/Excel), unitPrice?, updatedAt

### replacement_logs
logId, module(equipment/facility/boiler), factoryId, assetId, assetNameSnapshot, assetNoSnapshot, reporterUserIdSnapshot, reporterNameSnapshot, ts, yearMonth(YYYY-MM), type(维修/保养/预防/紧急), locationIdSnapshot, locationNameSnapshot, items[{partSkuId, partNameSnapshot, partCodeSnapshot, qty, unitCost, itemCost}], totalRepairCost, remark, images[], clientOfflineId(幂等), createdAt

### alerts
alertId, factoryId, assetId, partSkuId, yearMonth, thresholdValue, currentQty, status(OPEN/ACK), ackByUserId, ackTs, ackNote, createdAt

### asset_part_thresholds
assetId+partSkuId(联合键), thresholdMonthly, active, updatedAt

### monthly_part_usage
factoryId, assetId+partSkuId+yearMonth(联合键), qtySum, lastUpdatedAt

### factories
factoryId, factoryName, factoryCode(唯一), address, status, createdAt, updatedAt

### asset_locations
locationId, assetId, locationName, sortOrder, active, updatedAt

### location_part_map
mapId, assetId, locationId, partSkuId, active

### inventory (inventory_records)
inventoryId, factoryId, partSkuId, partNameSnapshot, partCodeSnapshot, unitSnapshot, specModelSnapshot, currentQty, avgUnitCost(加权平均), totalCostValue, lowStockThreshold, lastInboundAt, lastOutboundAt, updatedAt

### inventory_inbound
inboundId, factoryId, partSkuId, partNameSnapshot, partCodeSnapshot, qty, unitPrice, totalPrice, supplier, batchNo, remark, operatorUserId, operatorNameSnapshot, ts, yearMonth, createdAt

### 补充集合
- **inventory_outbound_logs**: outboundId, factoryId, partSkuId, qty, unitCostAtTime, totalCost, replacementLogId, assetId, ts, yearMonth
- **inventory_alerts**: alertId, factoryId, partSkuId, currentQty, threshold, status(OPEN/ACK)

---

## 二、锅炉房 MySQL 表（TDSQL-C 8.0，16 张）

### factory
id(PK), name, short_name, address, contact_person, contact_phone, initial_fuel_stock(DECIMAL), stock_base_date(DATE), status(TINYINT), created_by, created_at, updated_at

### boiler
id(PK), factory_id(FK→factory), name, model, rated_capacity(DECIMAL 吨/时), fuel_type, sort_order, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at

### steam_customer
id(PK), factory_id(FK→factory), name, contact_person, contact_phone, sort_order, status, created_by, created_at, updated_at

### app_user
id(PK), openid(UNIQUE), nickname, avatar_url, phone, real_name, role(ENUM:admin/viewer/operator), factory_id(FK→factory), status, last_login_at, created_at, updated_at

### daily_record
id(PK), factory_id(FK)+record_date(DATE) UNIQUE, total_water, total_fuel_consumed, fuel_intake, created_by(FK→app_user), remark, created_at, updated_at

### boiler_daily_data (文档中叫 boiler_data)
id(PK), record_id(FK→daily_record), boiler_id(FK→boiler), start_time(TIME), end_time(TIME), running_hours(自动算), steam_production, electricity, steam_pressure, steam_temperature, exhaust_temperature, remark

### customer_steam_data
id(PK), record_id(FK→daily_record), customer_id(FK→steam_customer), steam_usage(DECIMAL), remark

### price_config
id(PK), factory_id?(FK), price_type(ENUM:electricity/fuel/water), unit_price(DECIMAL), unit, effective_from(DATE), effective_to(DATE NULL=长期), remark

### daily_derived_metrics
id(PK), record_id(FK→daily_record UNIQUE), factory_id, record_date, total_steam_production, total_steam_usage, total_electricity, electricity_per_steam, fuel_per_steam, water_per_steam, steam_loss_rate(%), fuel_stock_estimate, fuel_stock_days, electricity_cost, fuel_cost, water_cost, total_cost, cost_per_steam

### alert_rule
id(PK), factory_id?(FK), name, metric_key, threshold_min, threshold_max, comparison, message_template, severity(ENUM:info/warning/critical), notify_method, status

### alert_log
id(PK), rule_id(FK→alert_rule), factory_id, record_date, metric_key, metric_value, threshold_value, severity, message, status(ENUM:pending/acknowledged/resolved), resolved_by, resolved_at, resolve_note, triggered_at

### ai_analysis
id(PK), factory_id, analysis_type(ENUM:daily_report/diagnosis/forecast/weekly_report/monthly_report), analysis_date, input_data(JSON), prompt_text, raw_response, key_findings(JSON), suggestions(JSON), risk_level(ENUM:low/medium/high/critical), token_input, token_output, cost_estimate, feedback_score, feedback_note

### ai_chat_history
id(PK), user_id(FK→app_user), session_id, role(ENUM:user/assistant), content(TEXT), token_count

### extended_field
id(PK), target_type(ENUM:boiler/factory/customer)+field_key(UNIQUE), field_label, field_type(ENUM:number/text/select), unit, options(JSON), sort_order, status

### extended_field_value
id(PK), field_id(FK→extended_field), record_id, record_type, field_value

### operation_log
id(PK), user_id(FK→app_user), user_name, action(ENUM:create/update/delete), target_table, target_id, before_data(JSON), after_data(JSON), ip_address, remark, created_at
